
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#dcecff">
<meta name="description" content="A little universe filled with memories, wishes and happiness.">
<title>A Little Universe for Yasvani ♡</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="css/style.css">
</head>

<body>

<div class="progress" id="progress"></div>

<nav>
  <div class="brand">for Yasvani ♡</div>
  <div class="navlinks">
    <a href="#home">Home</a>
    <a href="#memories">Memories</a>
    <a href="#letter">Letter</a>
    <a href="#final">End</a>
  </div>
</nav>

<!-- 01: WELCOME -->

<section class="sky" id="home">
  <div class="decor d1">✿</div>
  <div class="decor d2">☁️</div>
  <div class="inner reveal">
    <div class="eyebrow">A little universe made for you</div>
    <h1>Hey,<br><span class="accent">Yasvani.</span></h1>
    <p class="subtitle">
      Somewhere between the stars and the flowers,
      there is a little place that belongs to you.
    </p>
    <div class="heart">🩵</div>
    <a class="btn" href="#today">Enter your little world ✨</a>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 02: BIRTHDAY -->

<section class="blush" id="today">
  <div class="inner reveal">
    <div class="eyebrow">A day worth celebrating</div>
    <h2>Today is all about <span class="accent">you.</span></h2>
    <p class="subtitle">
      Another chapter, another collection of adventures,
      laughter and beautiful discoveries.
    </p>
    <div style="font-size:75px;margin:30px">🎀</div>
    <h3>Happy Birthday! ♡</h3>
    <p class="subtitle">May life be gentle with your beautiful heart.</p>
    <a class="btn" href="#reasons">Continue →</a>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 03: REASONS -->

<section class="paper" id="reasons">
  <div class="inner reveal">
    <div class="eyebrow">A collection of little things</div>
    <h2>Things that make you <span class="accent">special.</span></h2>
    <p class="subtitle">Some things deserve to be appreciated more often.</p>

    <div class="grid">
      <div class="tile"><span>🌸</span><p>Your little moments of kindness.</p></div>
      <div class="tile"><span>🦋</span><p>Your wonderfully unique personality.</p></div>
      <div class="tile"><span>☁️</span><p>The way ordinary moments can feel special.</p></div>
      <div class="tile"><span>✨</span><p>The happiness you bring to little moments.</p></div>
    </div>
    <a class="btn" href="#memories">Visit the scrapbook →</a>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 04: SCRAPBOOK -->

<section class="sky" id="memories">
  <div class="inner reveal">
    <div class="eyebrow">A scrapbook of little moments</div>
    <h2>Some moments deserve to <span class="accent">stay.</span></h2>
    <p class="subtitle">Not every beautiful memory needs a photograph.</p>

    <div class="timeline">
      <div class="memory">
        <h3>The beginning 🌷</h3>
        <p>A little chapter that started with a simple hello.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="memory">
        <h3>The laughter ☁️</h3>
        <p>Those conversations that made ordinary days better.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="memory">
        <h3>The unexpected moments 🦋</h3>
        <p>Little surprises that became lovely memories.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="memory">
        <h3>More chapters ahead ✨</h3>
        <p>There are still so many memories to make.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <a class="btn" href="#gallery">Photo memories →</a>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 05: GALLERY -->

<section class="blush" id="gallery-section">
  <div class="inner reveal">
    <div class="eyebrow">Little moments, forever frames</div>
    <h2>A gallery of <span class="accent">happiness.</span></h2>
    <p class="subtitle">A place for favourite photographs and memories.</p>

    <div class="gallery" id="gallery">
      <div class="photo">🌷</div>
      <div class="photo">🩵</div>
      <div class="photo">🦋</div>
      <div class="photo">✨</div>
    </div>

    <label class="btn" for="photoInput">＋ Add photographs</label>
    <input id="photoInput" type="file" accept="image/*" multiple hidden>
    <p class="subtitle" style="font-size:11px">
      Photo previews are temporary in this version.
    </p>
    <a class="btn" href="#happiness">Next surprise →</a>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 06: HAPPINESS -->

<section class="paper" id="happiness">
  <div class="inner reveal">
    <div class="eyebrow">A tiny happiness machine</div>
    <h2>A pocket full of <span class="accent">sunshine.</span></h2>
    <p class="subtitle">Whenever you need a little smile, open this box.</p>

    <div class="wish-card">
      <div style="font-size:35px">🎁</div>
      <div id="wishText">Your little surprise is waiting...</div>
      <button class="btn" onclick="newWish()">Give me a smile ♡</button>
    </div>
    <a class="btn" href="#cake">Something sweet →</a>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 07: CAKE -->

<section class="sky" id="cake">
  <div class="inner reveal">
    <div class="eyebrow">One beautiful birthday tradition</div>
    <h2>Make a <span class="accent">wish.</span></h2>
    <p class="subtitle">Keep your little dream safe in your heart.</p>

    <div id="flames" style="font-size:30px;margin-top:25px">🕯️ 🕯️ 🕯️</div>
    <div class="cake">🎂</div>
    <p id="cakeMessage">Three little candles, three little wishes.</p>
    <button class="btn" onclick="blowCandles()">Blow out the candles ✨</button>
    <a class="btn" href="#letter">A letter is waiting →</a>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 08: LETTER -->

<section class="blush" id="letter">
  <div class="inner reveal">
    <div class="eyebrow">A little note, from the heart</div>
    <h2>Something I wanted you to <span class="accent">read.</span></h2>

    <div class="letter-card">
      <div id="closedLetter">
        <div style="font-size:55px">💌</div>
        <h3>A letter for you</h3>
        <p class="subtitle">A few words wrapped in a little love.</p>
        <button class="btn" onclick="openLetter()">Open your letter ♡</button>
      </div>

      <div id="letterText">
        <h3>Dear Yasvani,</h3>
        <p>
          If I could gift you something beyond all the
          beautiful things in this world, it would be
          the ability to see yourself through the eyes
          of everyone who appreciates you.
        </p>
        <p>
          I hope you never forget how worthy you are
          of happiness, how much your dreams matter,
          and how beautiful it is to simply be yourself.
        </p>
        <p>
          May your difficult days become lighter,
          your happiest days unforgettable, and
          your heart always find reasons to smile.
        </p>
        <p>Keep growing. Keep dreaming. ♡</p>
        <p style="text-align:right;color:#d98eaa">
          With warmest wishes.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <a class="btn" href="#stars">One last surprise →</a>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 09: STARS -->

<section class="sky" id="stars">
  <div class="inner reveal">
    <div class="eyebrow">A sky full of possibilities</div>
    <h2>Choose a <span class="accent">little star.</span></h2>
    <p class="subtitle">Tap a star to discover a little wish.</p>
    <div class="star-sky" id="starSky"></div>
    <p id="starMessage">Your star is waiting ✨</p>
    <a class="btn" href="#final">Final page →</a>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 10: FINAL -->

<section class="blush" id="final">
  <div class="inner reveal">
    <div class="eyebrow">And this is only the beginning</div>
    <h1>Keep shining,<br><span class="accent">Yasvani.</span></h1>
    <div class="final-heart">🩵</div>
    <p class="subtitle">
      May you find magic in ordinary mornings,
      courage in difficult moments, laughter in
      unexpected places and happiness in little things.
    </p>
    <h3 style="margin-top:25px">Happy Birthday, once again. ♡</h3>
    <button class="btn" onclick="window.scrollTo({top:0,behavior:'smooth'})">
      Relive your little world ↺
    </button>
  </div>
</section>

<footer>
  Made with care, little details and lots of ♡
  <br>A Little Universe for Yasvani
</footer>

<script src="js/script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
